msgid "Creating a new build"
msgstr "创建新的构建"

#: src/reference/guide/sbt-new.md:4
msgid "To start a new build with `sbt`, use `sbt new`."
msgstr "要使用 `sbt` 开始新的构建，请使用 `sbt new`。"

